1
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,280
(My name is Yu Song.)

2
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:21,160
(I majored in psychology in college.)

3
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,280
(My parents have lived abroad
for years.)

4
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,360
(Everything I just said)

5
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:29,200
(was a lie, except my name.)

6
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,160
(My father was murdered years ago.)

7
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:33,560
(The case remains unsolved
due to a lack of evidence.)

8
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:34,960
(For years, the police and I)

9
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,760
(never stopped chasing leads.)

10
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,240
(I'm here today...)

11
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,640
(Everything I've kept hidden)

12
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,440
(was to keep my investigation secret.)

13
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:44,240
(I will uncover the whole truth.)

14
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:49,380
=Dear Song=

15
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:54,180
=Episode 1=
(A Victory of Lies)

16
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:58,840
Hello.

17
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,160
I'm here to interview for the job
as Ms. Song Cheng's personal assistant.

18
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:03,720
Come in.

19
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:13,000
(Nigang City is a mix of good
and bad people.)

20
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:15,480
(The truth lies behind the glamour.)

21
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,760
(Only by growing stronger)

22
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,280
(can I get into the inner circle.)

23
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,960
(Only once I'm in the inner circle)

24
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:23,760
(can I see everything that's hidden.)

25
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:31,280
The previous owner, Ms. Yu Meng,

26
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,800
bought this at auction overseas.

27
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:36,480
When Mr. Song bought this house,

28
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:37,800
this piece caught his eye right away.

29
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:38,680
He really liked it,

30
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,800
so he kept it.

31
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,520
You mean...

32
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:44,080
Yu Meng, founder of the
beauty brand Yueji?

33
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:45,880
I admire her.

34
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,200
Since you know,

35
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,840
be careful, then.

36
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,080
If you break it,

37
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,440
you couldn't afford to replace it.

38
00:01:52,180 --> 00:01:53,580
(Yu Song, Position: Personal Assistant
Age: 23, Experience: 3 years)

39
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:55,640
I'm Chen.

40
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:57,040
The Song family's butler.

41
00:01:57,720 --> 00:02:00,440
You've both passed the resume screening,

42
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:01,520
but next,

43
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:03,680
you'll face a test from Ms. Song Cheng.

44
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:05,320
Here's your rosewood.

45
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,320
You have 30 minutes

46
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:09,200
to carve it into any shape you like.

47
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:10,440
This piece of wood

48
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:11,600
is worth 30,000 yuan.

49
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,800
Whether you succeed or not,

50
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:15,040
you can keep it.

51
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,120
Clock's ticking.

52
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,400
Start.

53
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,880
30,000 yuan for a piece of junk wood?

54
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,240
She's just an illegitimate daughter,

55
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,840
yet she's making us jump through hoops.

56
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:39,000
Ms. Song Cheng likes woodworking.

57
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,920
No wonder she'd set a test like this.

58
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,000
The carving knife's on your side.

59
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,800
Could you pass it?

60
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:01,680
Sorry.

61
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,080
My hand slipped.

62
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,760
It's fine.

63
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,000
I thought

64
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,720
you were going to kill me to shut me up.

65
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,640
Of course not.

66
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:17,600
Instead of hurting you, Ms. Yu,

67
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,200
I'd rather do this.

68
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:35,520
Ms. Yu complained

69
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:37,400
that making a top student carve wood

70
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,600
is a waste of talent.

71
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,840
I only tried to remind her

72
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:42,920
to respect Ms. Song Cheng's hobby.

73
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,240
But then...

74
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:48,040
The Song family can't keep
someone this hotheaded.

75
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:49,560
Ms. Yu.

76
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,640
You're out.

77
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:56,880
Ms. Chen.

78
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:59,200
The Song family bans nepotism.

79
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:01,000
Imagine the Song family finding out

80
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,520
you're reselling luxury goods

81
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,040
and trying to hire someone unqualified.

82
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:05,400
Your own niece, no less.

83
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:07,040
How do you think they'd react?

84
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,840
I'm sorry.

85
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:15,000
Neither of you passed today.

86
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:18,240
We don't allow outsiders to linger here.

87
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:21,320
Please leave, both of you.

88
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:23,440
Auntie!

89
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,320
You said you'd get me...

90
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:24,760
Shut up!

91
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:34,880
Ms. Chen.

92
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,720
I think...

93
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:38,520
She's the right fit.

94
00:04:50,200 --> 00:04:51,000
Ms. Yu.

95
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,680
(Song)
I'm curious

96
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,640
why you carved your name into it.

97
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,800
Exchanging names is basic courtesy.

98
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,600
I know your name already,

99
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,200
but I never got the chance

100
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,720
to introduce myself.

101
00:05:03,520 --> 00:05:05,280
If I fail this interview,

102
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:07,040
consider it my way of saying hello.

103
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,800
Ms. Song Cheng, is that why
you chose me?

104
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:12,400
No.

105
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,000
Because of one little detail.

106
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,840
(Here's your rosewood.)

107
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,480
(You have 30 minutes)

108
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,400
(to carve it into any shape you like.)

109
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:26,440
(Instead of hurting you, Ms. Yu,)

110
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:28,000
(I'd rather do this.)

111
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:30,680
(Help!)

112
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,600
(Somebody, help!)

113
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:43,260
(Cheng)

114
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:45,280
Now...

115
00:05:45,880 --> 00:05:47,320
We can finally meet properly.

116
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,480
Ms. Song Cheng!

117
00:06:04,180 --> 00:06:05,100
(GangA 88555)

118
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,400
Ms. Song Cheng!

119
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,000
Are you alright?

120
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,200
Dad...

121
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,600
Mr. Song.

122
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:54,480
Ms. Song Cheng was just
a little shaken up.

123
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,800
Luckily, she has no visible injuries.

124
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:58,000
I just got my international
nursing certification in June.

125
00:06:58,080 --> 00:06:59,800
If you're still concerned,

126
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:01,600
you can call the family doctor.

127
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,920
Cheng...

128
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,600
How are you feeling?

129
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:09,440
Dad.

130
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:10,240
I'm fine.

131
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,240
Ms. Song Cheng's fine,

132
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:15,040
but only because she's lucky.

133
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:17,120
After such a serious accident,

134
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,840
I'm afraid Ms. Yu

135
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:21,680
isn't fit to be a personal assistant.

136
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:24,240
Dad.

137
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,200
I really like Yu Song.

138
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:27,600
What just happened

139
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,640
was unexpected.

140
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:30,000
It's not Yu Song's fault.

141
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,520
Despite what just happened,

142
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,080
you must have seen

143
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,640
how I reacted.

144
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:40,840
I promise,

145
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,920
no matter what danger lies ahead,

146
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,480
I'll do what I did today

147
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:46,240
and protect her with my life.

148
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:48,720
Mr. Song.

149
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:49,600
I've checked everything.

150
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,840
The accident was caused by worn
brake lines

151
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:53,080
and an aging battery.

152
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:54,480
Neither was replaced in time.

153
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,600
Cheng, since you like her,

154
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:03,200
Ms. Yu Song can stay.

155
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:06,600
Thanks, Dad.

156
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:09,040
(New Hire Handbook)
The Song family rulebook.

157
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:09,680
Your uniform,

158
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,400
and all your supplies are in here.

159
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,280
Remember,

160
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:17,920
Mr. Song is allergic to
all perfume on the market.

161
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,920
So whenever you come to the Song house,

162
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,880
you can only use
the family's custom fragrance.

163
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:23,600
Understood?

164
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:24,800
Got it.

165
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,280
Thanks.

166
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,200
(GangA 88555)
Ms. Yu.

167
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,240
Get in.

168
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,480
Mr. Song asked me to take you home.

169
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,120
Thanks.

170
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:06,800
I haven't adjusted it in a while.

171
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:08,800
No one usually sits up front.

172
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,200
Thanks.

173
00:09:17,260 --> 00:09:19,900
(Fuxing Bridge)

174
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,200
I'm home.

175
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,000
Want to come in?

176
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,800
Sure.

177
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,920
I almost hit you today.

178
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:11,200
Scared?

179
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,000
Not at all.

180
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:16,280
I trust your braking skills, Mr. Jing.

181
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:21,360
Thanks.

182
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:25,200
I trust your skills, too.

183
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:27,320
(We've been planning this for so long.)

184
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:29,160
(We're finally in the Song household.)

185
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:31,200
(Not just for ourselves,)

186
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:33,440
(but for the truth.)

187
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:34,800
(If you hadn't helped me earlier today)

188
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:36,440
(by rigging the wheelchair)

189
00:10:36,680 --> 00:10:38,320
(so I could stage that rescue,)

190
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,880
(it wouldn't have gone so smoothly.)

191
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,440
(I timed it perfectly.)

192
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:44,480
(I'd never let Song Cheng get hurt.
She's innocent.)

193
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,320
(To the Song family,)

194
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:48,080
(an employee's loyalty)

195
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:50,440
(matters as much as a good resume.)

196
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:53,080
(They'd never guess...)

197
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:55,360
(I've already planted someone)

198
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,440
(inside the Song household.)
